<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>StreamPro - Welcome</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rajdhani:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #ff0055;
    --secondary: #00d2ff;
    --bg-dark: #050505;
    --text-main: #ffffff;
    --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  body {
    margin: 0; font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    background-color: var(--bg-dark);
    color: var(--text-main);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* --- Navbar --- */
  nav {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 8%; position: absolute; width: 84%; top: 0; z-index: 10;
  }
  .logo { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .logo span { color: var(--primary); }
  
  .nav-btn {
    background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    color: #fff; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 30px; 
    cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; font-weight: 600;
  }
  .nav-btn:hover { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); }

  /* --- Hero Section --- */
  .hero {
    height: 100vh; width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.3), #050505), 
                url('https://wallpapers.com/images/hd/netflix-background-gs7hjuwvv2g0e9fj.jpg'); 
    background-size: cover; background-position: center;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
    text-align: center; padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 60px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.1;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
    animation: fadeIn Up 1s ease;
  }
  .hero span { color: var(--primary); }
  
  .hero p {
    font-size: 20px; max-width: 700px; color: #ccc; margin: 20px 0 40px;
    animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease;
  }

  /* Call to Action Button */
  .cta-btn {
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--primary), #ff00cc);
    color: white; border: none; padding: 15px 50px;
    font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 50px;
    cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.4);
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  }
  .cta-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.7); }

  /* --- Features Section --- */
  .features {
    padding: 80px 8%; background: #090909;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .section-title { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 50px; font-weight: 700; }
  .section-title span { border-bottom: 3px solid var(--secondary); padding-bottom: 5px; }

  .feature-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 30px;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--glass); padding: 40px 20px; border-radius: 15px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); transition: 0.3s;
  }
  .feature-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); border-color: var(--secondary); }
  
  .icon-box {
    font-size: 40px; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .feature-card h3 { margin: 10px 0; font-size: 22px; }
  .feature-card p { color: #aaa; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }

  /* --- App Info / About --- */
  .about-app {
    padding: 80px 8%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 50px;
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #0f0c29, #1a1a2e);
  }
  .about-text { flex: 1; }
  .about-text h2 { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .about-text p { color: #ccc; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  
  .about-img { flex: 1; text-align: center; }
  .about-img img { 
    width: 100%; max-width: 400px; border-radius: 20px; 
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.2); 
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }

  /* --- Footer --- */
  footer {
    padding: 40px; text-align: center; background: #000; color: #555;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }
  .social-icons a { color: #fff; margin: 0 10px; font-size: 20px; transition: 0.3s; }
  .social-icons a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }
    .about-app { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    .nav-btn { display: none; }
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="logo">Stream<span>Pro</span></div>
  <button class="nav-btn">Login</button>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Unlimited TV, Sports <br> & <span>Live Events</span></h1>
  <p>Experience buffer-free streaming with our premium IPTV player. Access thousands of channels anytime, anywhere.</p>
  
  <a href="player.html" class="cta-btn">
    <i class="fas fa-play"></i> START STREAMING
  </a>
</section>

<section class="features">
  <div class="section-title"><span>Why Choose Us?</span></div>
  
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></div>
      <h3>Super Fast</h3>
      <p>Lightning fast loading speeds with zero buffering technology.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-tv"></i></div>
      <h3>Live TV</h3>
      <p>Access 1000+ local and international TV channels for free.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i></div>
      <h3>Responsive</h3>
      <p>Optimized for all devices including Mobile, Tablet, and Desktop.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-app">
  <div class="about-text">
    <h2>The Ultimate <span style="color:var(--secondary)">IPTV Experience</span></h2>
    <p>
      StreamPro is a cutting-edge web-based IPTV solution designed for entertainment lovers. 
      Whether you are into Live Sports, Breaking News, or Blockbuster Movies, we have it all sorted for you.
      <br><br>
      Our advanced HLS player ensures high-quality playback even on slow internet connections. 
      No installation needed, just click and play!
    </p>
    <a href="player.html" class="nav-btn" style="display:inline-block; background:var(--secondary); border:none;">Browse Channels</a>
  </div>
  <div class="about-img">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593784697956-141829e921d7?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="App Preview">
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="social-icons">
    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a>
    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:20px;">&copy; 2024 StreamPro IPTV. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
